---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Virvly">
  <!-- Scrollable page container -->
  <div class="relative min-h-screen bg-brand-paper font-body text-brand-charcoal overflow-x-hidden">
    
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <Header activePage="privacy" />

    <!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
    <section class="relative min-h-[40vh] flex items-center justify-center pt-28 pb-16 md:pt-36 md:pb-20 text-white overflow-hidden bg-brand-blue-deep">
      <!-- Background overlay elements -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-blue-deep/50 via-brand-blue-deep/80 to-brand-blue-deep/98 z-10"></div>
      
      <!-- Hero Content -->
      <div class="wrap relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl px-4">
        <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-[12px] md:text-[13px] tracking-widest text-brand-orange uppercase block mb-3">
          Legal Agreement
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-[36px] sm:text-[44px] md:text-[48px] leading-tight tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
       <p class="font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-white max-w-xl">
          Last updated: August 28, 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEGAL DOCUMENT CONTAINER -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-white relative z-20 -mt-8 rounded-t-3xl shadow-2xl">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="prose max-w-none text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-brand-grey-1 space-y-12 font-body">
          
          <div class="border-b border-black/5 pb-8 space-y-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-charcoal text-[17px]">
              At Virvly, we value your trust and are fully committed to protecting your privacy.
            </p>
            <p>
              This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit and use our website (<a href="/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">virvly.com</a>) and our web application platform, including any media form, mobile application, or other channel connected thereto (collectively, the "Platform").
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 1 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
              We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us and information that is automatically captured when you use our platform.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Personal Data:</strong> Personally identifiable information, such as your name, email address, and billing details when you register on our platform or buy/sell photos.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Selfie Data (Face Matcher):</strong> If you use our photo-matching application, you upload a selfie or portrait. This selfie is used purely to generate a face vector to compare against photographs uploaded by photographers to find photos you appear in.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Financial Data:</strong> Financial details (like credit card numbers or banking/Stripe connection details) are handled directly by our payment processor, Stripe. We do not store credit card numbers on our servers.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 2 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">2. AI-Based Face Matching & Selfie Policy</h2>
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-charcoal">
              Our face-matching technology is designed with privacy and security at its core.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">No Permanent Storage of Selfies:</strong> Your selfie is uploaded temporarily to perform the mathematical face match. Once matches are computed, your raw selfie is automatically discarded and is NOT retained or sold to third parties.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Restricted Access:</strong> Face matching vectors are used solely to match you with your photos. No database of names linked to facial recognition matrices is built or maintained.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">In-Photo Visibility:</strong> When you perform a search, you will only see photos that our system identifies as containing you.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 3 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>
              We process your information for purposes based on legitimate business interests, fulfilling our contract with you, and compliance with our legal obligations:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
              <li>To facilitate account creation and the logon process.</li>
              <li>To deliver the services you purchase or request.</li>
              <li>To verify photos you are present in via our interactive matching platform.</li>
              <li>To process transaction payouts to photographers and charge customers.</li>
              <li>To respond to user inquiries and offer support.</li>
              <li>To request feedback or send administrative updates.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 4 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">4. Data Sharing and Disclosures</h2>
            <p>
              We only share your information with your consent, to comply with laws, to provide you with services, or to fulfill business obligations.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Service Providers:</strong> We share data with third-party vendors who perform services for us, such as payment processing (Stripe) and database hosting.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Photographer Connection:</strong> When you purchase a photo, the photographer is notified that a sale was completed. The photographer does not receive your raw selfie.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-brand-charcoal">Legal Requirements:</strong> We may disclose your information where we are legally required to do so to comply with applicable law, governmental requests, or judicial proceedings.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 5 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">5. Security of Your Information</h2>
            <p>
              We use administrative, technical, and physical security measures to help protect your personal information. All uploaded photos are protected in transit using Secure Socket Layer (SSL) encryption, and are stored in secure cloud servers. While we have taken reasonable steps to secure the personal information you provide to us, please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 6 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">6. Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
              We will only keep your personal information for as long as it is necessary for the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 7 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">7. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
            <p>
              Depending on your location (e.g., European Union / GDPR, or California / CCPA), you may have certain rights regarding your personal information, including:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4">
              <li>The right to request access to and obtain a copy of your personal information.</li>
              <li>The right to request rectification of inaccurate data.</li>
              <li>The right to request erasure of your data ("right to be forgotten").</li>
              <li>The right to object to or restrict processing of your personal information.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details provided below.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 8 -->
          <div class="space-y-5">
            <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-charcoal border-b border-black/5 pb-2">8. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
              If you have questions or comments about this Privacy Policy, please write to us at:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-brand-paper-2 border border-black/5 rounded-xl p-5 mt-3 space-y-2">
              <p class="font-heading font-bold text-brand-charcoal text-[15.5px]">Virvly Security & Privacy Desk</p>
              <p class="text-[14px]">Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@virvly.com" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline font-semibold font-mono">privacy@virvly.com</a></p>
              <p class="text-[14px]">Alternate: <a href="mailto:hello@virvly.com" class="text-brand-blue hover:underline font-semibold font-mono">hello@virvly.com</a></p>
              <p class="text-[14px] pt-2 text-brand-grey-2 border-t border-black/5">You can also use our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-orange hover:underline font-semibold">contact page</a> to submit an inquiry.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <Footer />

  </div>
</Layout>
